# Everything built is built inside the image, so nothing built outside it rides along: a `dist/`
# or `node_modules` from the host is another platform's idea of the same code.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
.git
.github
.claude
**/*.log

# The API's own state on a developer's machine (uploaded originals, logs) and per-machine config.
**/.data
**/appconfig.local.yaml
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Tests never run in the image, and the build tsconfigs read `src` alone, so editing one should not
# rebuild it.
apps/*/tests
packages/*/tests
